{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjrxAENjfqWr3MUBuwBx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UnFt7r7kQWd81Z2nMM6rrx","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch1.js","content":"// Chapter 1: First Incision. Lines are at most 90 characters: two rows of the box. Melodrama played straight.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c1_open', [\n  { stage: 'corridor', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 1', 'First Incision'] },\n  ['vale', 'Okay okay okay. St. Erasmus Harbor. Night shift. I know where the bathrooms are. I am a doctor.', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'Second-year resident, Doctor. Let us not get ahead of ourselves.'],\n  ['vale', 'Sorry! Hi. You\\'re Quill. Theatre 3. They said you\\'ve been here thirty-one years.', 'smile'],\n  ['quill', 'They say a great deal. I bring the instruments. You try not to drop anyone.'],\n  { narr: 'Port Anselm, North Atlantic. Rain, gulls, cranes, and a hospital the staff call St. Raz\\'s.' },\n  ['vale', 'The Chief\\'s at a Foundation dinner and the on-call went home with the flu. So who\\'s on?'],\n  ['quill', 'You are, Doctor.'],\n  ['vale', 'Me is on?', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'Agnes Pellow, seventy-four. Fell through her greenhouse roof while repotting a begonia.'],\n  ['quill', 'She is in Theatre 3 with a great deal of glass in her arm. She would like it back.'],\n  { choose: ['I can do this.', 'I think I\\'m going to be sick.'], prompt: 'My first solo. All right. All right.', who: 'vale', replies: [['quill', 'Yes. That is what they all say. Hands, please.'], ['quill', 'After, Doctor. There is a bucket. It has seen better surgeons than you.']] },\n  { stage: 'scrub', mask: true },\n  ['quill', 'Now then. The wheel, Doctor. Eight instruments. Eight directions. Always in the same place.'],\n  ['quill', 'You ask for the forceps, I put the forceps in your palm. That is my entire job. Try me.'],\n  ['vale', 'Okay. Okay. Hi, Mrs. Pellow. You can\\'t hear me. Sorry. Hi.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c1_after', [\n  { stage: 'scrub', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'tired'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'She\\'s fine. She\\'s FINE. I did that. Did you see that? I did that with my hands.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'My hands won\\'t stop shaking.', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'They stop around year thirty, Doctor. I\\'m told.'],\n  ['vale', 'Quill, is that the glass? In a jam jar?'],\n  ['quill', 'For the grandchildren. She was firm. I labeled it.'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'smile']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'New girl! Odalys. Radiology. Do you want half a sandwich? I have thirty films and one sandwich.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'I\\'m Immy. Sorry. Vale. Doctor Vale. I don\\'t know why I said that like a question.'],\n  ['odalys', 'You have a trombone player upstairs with a chart that says hernia. Look at his film. LOOK.'],\n  ['odalys', 'Do you know what a hernia looks like? It doesn\\'t look like THAT. Doesn\\'t look like anything!'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smirk']] },\n  ['percy', 'Hernia. Obviously.', 'smirk'],\n  ['percy', 'Dr. Whitlock. Percival. Top of my year, second year running. You\\'re the one with the clogs.', 'smirk'],\n  ['odalys', 'Percy, I swear on this sandwich, that is not a hernia.', 'angry'],\n  ['percy', 'A surgeon reads the chart, Ferreira. A tech reads the sandwich. Good night, Dr. Vale.', 'smirk'],\n  { leave: 'percy' },\n  ['vale', 'Can I just... look at it again? Before I sign anything?', 'sad'],\n  ['odalys', 'Oh, I like you. Oh, this is going to be a disaster.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c2_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'ward', enter: [['slide', 'right'], ['vale', 'left', 'smile']] },\n  ['slide', 'Thirty-nine years I been reaching for that low B-flat. You telling me it was a cork?', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'A spit-valve cork. Swallowed. It was sitting in the mass like a pearl. Sorry, I\\'m so sorry.'],\n  ['slide', '1987. The Blue Lantern. I laughed mid-solo. I wondered where that went.', 'smile'],\n  { stage: 'office', leave: 'slide', enter: [['oyelaran', 'right']] },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Dr. Vale. You overruled a chart signed by a colleague. At three in the morning. On a hunch.'],\n  ['vale', 'It wasn\\'t a hunch, Chief, there was a film, and Odalys said, and it hummed, I mean, it...', 'shock'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'A surgeon who argues with a chart. How tiresome.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Do it again.', 'smile'],\n  { narr: 'She does not look up. She takes a small white pill, and pours herself no water at all.' },\n  { stage: 'corridor', leave: 'oyelaran', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['quill', 'That was nearly a compliment, Doctor. I would have it framed.'],\n  { sfx: 'foghorn', shake: 2 },\n  ['vale', 'What was that? That wasn\\'t the foghorn. Quill, the whole building just...', 'shock'],\n  { flash: '#ffffff', sfx: 'bang' },\n  ['quill', 'Berth Nine. That will be the crane.'],\n  { cine: 'gurney' },\n  ['quill', 'One coming in. The Chief is across the city. There is only you, Doctor.'],\n  ['vale', 'Okay okay okay. Okay. Sorry! Sorry. Who am I apologizing to? Okay.', 'shock'],\n]);\nS('c3_after', [\n  { stage: 'gallery', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'He died. Quill, he died on the table, and then it all went... slow. The rain stopped.', 'shock'],\n  ['vale', 'I had time. I had so much time. I sealed all six and I had time left over.'],\n  ['quill', 'How long did that feel, Doctor?'],\n  ['vale', 'A minute? Two?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'Eleven seconds.'],\n  ['quill', 'We don\\'t discuss it in the lift.'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'mid']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Mr. Rennie is asking about his dog. So I gather he will live. Sit down before you fall down.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I have stood in this gallery for thirty years. I know what I watched.'],\n  ['vale', 'Chief, I don\\'t know what happened. I think I need to be tested for something. Is it a stroke?', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'There is an old word in theatre, Doctor. We do not put it on charts.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'The Steady. Some surgeons can lean on a moment, and it gives.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Bartholomew has passed instruments to three of them. Do not make a fuss about it.'],\n  ['vale', 'Who were the other two?'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Go home, Dr. Vale. That is an order. And for heaven\\'s sake, eat something.', 'tired'],\n]);\n})();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17142,"cache_read_input_tokens":501748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17142},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"455aabbf-dbfa-409a-91df-ba2177dd6342","uuid":"318054e7-95d1-484e-b6fc-4d536527739e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:30:32.952Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjrx9v1pkyh1mq9ahE33","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UnFt7r7kQWd81Z2nMM6rrx":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch1.js","content":"// Chapter 1: First Incision. Lines are at most 90 characters: two rows of the box. Melodrama played straight.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c1_open', [\n  { stage: 'corridor', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 1', 'First Incision'] },\n  ['vale', 'Okay okay okay. St. Erasmus Harbor. Night shift. I know where the bathrooms are. I am a doctor.', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'Second-year resident, Doctor. Let us not get ahead of ourselves.'],\n  ['vale', 'Sorry! Hi. You\\'re Quill. Theatre 3. They said you\\'ve been here thirty-one years.', 'smile'],\n  ['quill', 'They say a great deal. I bring the instruments. You try not to drop anyone.'],\n  { narr: 'Port Anselm, North Atlantic. Rain, gulls, cranes, and a hospital the staff call St. Raz\\'s.' },\n  ['vale', 'The Chief\\'s at a Foundation dinner and the on-call went home with the flu. So who\\'s on?'],\n  ['quill', 'You are, Doctor.'],\n  ['vale', 'Me is on?', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'Agnes Pellow, seventy-four. Fell through her greenhouse roof while repotting a begonia.'],\n  ['quill', 'She is in Theatre 3 with a great deal of glass in her arm. She would like it back.'],\n  { choose: ['I can do this.', 'I think I\\'m going to be sick.'], prompt: 'My first solo. All right. All right.', who: 'vale', replies: [['quill', 'Yes. That is what they all say. Hands, please.'], ['quill', 'After, Doctor. There is a bucket. It has seen better surgeons than you.']] },\n  { stage: 'scrub', mask: true },\n  ['quill', 'Now then. The wheel, Doctor. Eight instruments. Eight directions. Always in the same place.'],\n  ['quill', 'You ask for the forceps, I put the forceps in your palm. That is my entire job. Try me.'],\n  ['vale', 'Okay. Okay. Hi, Mrs. Pellow. You can\\'t hear me. Sorry. Hi.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c1_after', [\n  { stage: 'scrub', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'tired'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'She\\'s fine. She\\'s FINE. I did that. Did you see that? I did that with my hands.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'My hands won\\'t stop shaking.', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'They stop around year thirty, Doctor. I\\'m told.'],\n  ['vale', 'Quill, is that the glass? In a jam jar?'],\n  ['quill', 'For the grandchildren. She was firm. I labeled it.'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'smile']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'New girl! Odalys. Radiology. Do you want half a sandwich? I have thirty films and one sandwich.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'I\\'m Immy. Sorry. Vale. Doctor Vale. I don\\'t know why I said that like a question.'],\n  ['odalys', 'You have a trombone player upstairs with a chart that says hernia. Look at his film. LOOK.'],\n  ['odalys', 'Do you know what a hernia looks like? It doesn\\'t look like THAT. Doesn\\'t look like anything!'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smirk']] },\n  ['percy', 'Hernia. Obviously.', 'smirk'],\n  ['percy', 'Dr. Whitlock. Percival. Top of my year, second year running. You\\'re the one with the clogs.', 'smirk'],\n  ['odalys', 'Percy, I swear on this sandwich, that is not a hernia.', 'angry'],\n  ['percy', 'A surgeon reads the chart, Ferreira. A tech reads the sandwich. Good night, Dr. Vale.', 'smirk'],\n  { leave: 'percy' },\n  ['vale', 'Can I just... look at it again? Before I sign anything?', 'sad'],\n  ['odalys', 'Oh, I like you. Oh, this is going to be a disaster.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c2_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'ward', enter: [['slide', 'right'], ['vale', 'left', 'smile']] },\n  ['slide', 'Thirty-nine years I been reaching for that low B-flat. You telling me it was a cork?', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'A spit-valve cork. Swallowed. It was sitting in the mass like a pearl. Sorry, I\\'m so sorry.'],\n  ['slide', '1987. The Blue Lantern. I laughed mid-solo. I wondered where that went.', 'smile'],\n  { stage: 'office', leave: 'slide', enter: [['oyelaran', 'right']] },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Dr. Vale. You overruled a chart signed by a colleague. At three in the morning. On a hunch.'],\n  ['vale', 'It wasn\\'t a hunch, Chief, there was a film, and Odalys said, and it hummed, I mean, it...', 'shock'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'A surgeon who argues with a chart. How tiresome.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Do it again.', 'smile'],\n  { narr: 'She does not look up. She takes a small white pill, and pours herself no water at all.' },\n  { stage: 'corridor', leave: 'oyelaran', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['quill', 'That was nearly a compliment, Doctor. I would have it framed.'],\n  { sfx: 'foghorn', shake: 2 },\n  ['vale', 'What was that? That wasn\\'t the foghorn. Quill, the whole building just...', 'shock'],\n  { flash: '#ffffff', sfx: 'bang' },\n  ['quill', 'Berth Nine. That will be the crane.'],\n  { cine: 'gurney' },\n  ['quill', 'One coming in. The Chief is across the city. There is only you, Doctor.'],\n  ['vale', 'Okay okay okay. Okay. Sorry! Sorry. Who am I apologizing to? Okay.', 'shock'],\n]);\nS('c3_after', [\n  { stage: 'gallery', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'He died. Quill, he died on the table, and then it all went... slow. The rain stopped.', 'shock'],\n  ['vale', 'I had time. I had so much time. I sealed all six and I had time left over.'],\n  ['quill', 'How long did that feel, Doctor?'],\n  ['vale', 'A minute? Two?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'Eleven seconds.'],\n  ['quill', 'We don\\'t discuss it in the lift.'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'mid']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Mr. Rennie is asking about his dog. So I gather he will live. Sit down before you fall down.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I have stood in this gallery for thirty years. I know what I watched.'],\n  ['vale', 'Chief, I don\\'t know what happened. I think I need to be tested for something. Is it a stroke?', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'There is an old word in theatre, Doctor. We do not put it on charts.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'The Steady. Some surgeons can lean on a moment, and it gives.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Bartholomew has passed instruments to three of them. Do not make a fuss about it.'],\n  ['vale', 'Who were the other two?'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Go home, Dr. Vale. That is an order. And for heaven\\'s sake, eat something.', 'tired'],\n]);\n})();\n"}}}
