d on the table, and then it all went... slow. The rain stopped.', 'shock'],\n  ['vale', 'I had time. I had so much time. I sealed all six and I had time left over.'],\n  ['quill', 'How long did that feel, Doctor?'],\n  ['vale', 'A minute? Two?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'Eleven seconds.'],\n  ['quill', 'We don\\'t discuss it in the lift.'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'mid']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Mr. Rennie is asking about his dog. So I gather he will live. Sit down before you fall down.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I have stood in this gallery for thirty years. I know what I watched.'],\n  ['vale', 'Chief, I don\\'t know what happened. I think I need to be tested for something. Is it a stroke?', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'There is an old word in theatre, Doctor. We do not put it on charts.'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'The Steady. Some surgeons can lean on a moment, and it gives.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Bartholomew has passed instruments to three of them. Do not make a fuss about it.'],\n  ['vale', 'Who were the other two?'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Go home, Dr. Vale. That is an order. And for heaven\\'s sake, eat something.', 'tired'],\n]);\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UnFt7r7kQWd81Z2nMM6rrx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjrxAENjfqWr3MUBuwBx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fdi59YHaCUAoV97wdqNeDC","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch2.js","content":"// Chapter 2: The Quiet Ones.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c4_open', [\n  { stage: 'harbor', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left']] },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 2', 'The Quiet Ones'] },\n  { narr: 'Three weeks on. The billboards say A LIFE WITHOUT PAIN. The new east wing shines over the harbor.' },\n  { stage: 'corridor', enter: [['harrow', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['harrow', 'Evening, Doctor! Lovely night. Is there someone I should see about this?', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'Sir, you have a fishing gaff through your side. All the way through. It\\'s coming out the back.', 'shock'],\n  ['harrow', 'So I\\'m told. Doesn\\'t hurt a bit! I would like to make the morning tide, if it\\'s all the same.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'That is... does that hurt when I do this?', 'shock'],\n  ['harrow', 'Not at all. I feel marvelous. Never better. I\\'ve been whistling all week. Listen.', 'smile'],\n  { sfx: 'gull' },\n  { enter: [['quill', 'mid']], leave: 'harrow' },\n  ['quill', 'Pain is how a body writes home, Doctor. That man has stopped writing.'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'Okay so don\\'t freak out, but your X-ray is humming.', 'shock'],\n  ['vale', 'X-rays don\\'t hum.'],\n  ['odalys', 'That\\'s what I said! And then I put my ear on it!', 'shout'],\n]);\nS('c4_after', [\n  { stage: 'gallery', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'You heard that, right? In there? It was singing. Quill, the thing in him was singing.', 'shock'],\n  { wait: 1.2 },\n  ['vale', 'Quill?'],\n  { narr: 'For the first time in thirty-one years, Bartholomew Quill says nothing at all.' },\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'It\\'s not in any database. Not one. I checked places I am not allowed to have checked.', 'shock'],\n  ['odalys', 'It\\'s synaptic tissue, like a nerve, but it\\'s colonial. Which means it\\'s a lot of little nerves.'],\n  ['odalys', 'That are alive. In a man. Who feels great.', 'shout'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'mid']], leave: 'odalys' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Not a word. Not to the board, not to the press, not to your mother.', 'angry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Not until I have spoken to the Foundation.'],\n  ['vale', 'The Foundation? Chief, what would the Foundation have to do with...?', 'shock'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They paid for your theatre lights, Dr. Vale. Go and do your rounds.', 'tired'],\n]);\nS('c5_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'ward', enter: [['ilse', 'right', 'cry'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['ilse', 'It hurts.', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'Oh, it hurts. Oh. It hurts so much. My hand. I can feel every string.', 'cry'],\n  ['vale', 'I\\'m sorry, I\\'m so sorry, I can get you something for that, let me just...', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'No. Don\\'t you dare.', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'Thank you.', 'smile'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', leave: 'ilse', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shout']] },\n  ['odalys', 'I found it! The captain. The violinist. Eleven others, all feeling great, all in the charts.', 'shout'],\n  ['odalys', 'Every one of them went to an Anodyne clinic. Every one is on Lull. It\\'s the miracle drug!', 'shout'],\n  ['vale', 'Lull is safe. Lull got my nan off morphine. Everyone\\'s on Lull. Half the night shift is on Lull.', 'shock'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smirk']], leave: 'odalys' },\n  ['percy', 'You\\'ve been up for forty hours, Vale. You\\'re hearing singing and accusing a charity.', 'smirk'],\n  ['percy', 'The gala is on Friday. In the new wing. Do try to wear shoes. You look terrible.', 'smirk'],\n  ['vale', 'You look tired too, Percy. Your hands are really steady, though.', 'sad'],\n  ['percy', 'Yes. They are, aren\\'t they.', 'neutral'],\n  { stage: 'gala', leave: ['percy', 'vale'], music: 'title' },\n  { enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']] },\n  ['hale', 'Pain is the last disease. We have beaten smallpox. We have beaten polio.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'I ask you to imagine a child who has never once been afraid of the needle.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired']], leave: 'hale' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'To Dr. Hale. To the Foundation. To the doors of St. Erasmus, which remain, thanks to him...', 'tired'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 3 },\n  { cine: 'gala' },\n  ['vale', 'CHIEF!', 'shout'],\n  ['quill', 'Theatre 3, Doctor. You will have to open her. There is no one else in this city I would hand it to.'],\n]);\nS('c6_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'tension', enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'cry']] },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Your suture line is adequate. Stop crying on it.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'You took Lull. How long? You\\'ve had it for how long? I had my hands in your chest and it SANG.', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'A year. For my hands. This hospital was three months from a padlock, Imogen.', 'tired'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Lucian Hale wrote a check, and asked one thing. Keep his patients out of our charts.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I knew. Not all of it. Enough. That is the whole of my confession, and I shall not repeat it.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They call it HUSH. Hyperplastic Undifferentiated Synaptic Hive. They grew it. It feeds on pain.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They sing, Doctor. So we name them like songs.'],\n  ['vale', 'How do I stop it? Chief, I can barely stop my own knees.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'You stretch a moment. There is someone who does more than that. She takes it back.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Yevgenia Sokolova. Surgeon of the hospital ship Samaritan\\'s Wake. She will be rude to you.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'mid']], sfx: 'clink' },\n  { narr: 'A tray hits the floor. Instruments scatter across the ward. Bartholomew Quill has dropped it.' },\n  { narr: 'He has not dropped one in thirty-one years.' },\n  ['quill', 'Forgive me. I shall get the mop.'],\n  { leave: ['quill', 'oyelaran'], enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']], music: 'none' },\n  { narr: 'On the ward television, the volume low, a kind face.' },\n  ['hale', 'I hear Dr. Oyelaran is recovering. Wonderful. That is wonderful news.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'She has given so much of herself. I do hope she gets some rest. I do hope everyone does.', 'smile'],\n]);\n})();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17142,"cache_read_input_tokens":501748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17142},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"455aabbf-dbfa-409a-91df-ba2177dd6342","uuid":"dcff0bb7-f26a-4b0d-adae-0c7769d852e1","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:31:02.953Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjrx9v1pkyh1mq9ahE33","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Fdi59YHaCUAoV97wdqNeDC":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch2.js","content":"// Chapter 2: The Quiet Ones.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c4_open', [\n  { stage: 'harbor', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left']] },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 2', 'The Quiet Ones'] },\n  { narr: 'Three weeks on. The billboards say A LIFE WITHOUT PAIN. The new east wing shines over the harbor.' },\n  { stage: 'corridor', enter: [['harrow', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['harrow', 'Evening, Doctor! Lovely night. Is there someone I should see about this?', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'Sir, you have a fishing gaff through your side. All the way through. It\\'s coming out the back.', 'shock'],\n  ['harrow', 'So I\\'m told. Doesn\\'t hurt a bit! I would like to make the morning tide, if it\\'s all the same.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'That is... does that hurt when I do this?', 'shock'],\n  ['harrow', 'Not at all. I feel marvelous. Never better. I\\'ve been whistling all week. Listen.', 'smile'],\n  { sfx: 'gull' },\n  { enter: [['quill', 'mid']], leave: 'harrow' },\n  ['quill', 'Pain is how a body writes home, Doctor. That man has stopped writing.'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'Okay so don\\'t freak out, but your X-ray is humming.', 'shock'],\n  ['vale', 'X-rays don\\'t hum.'],\n  ['odalys', 'That\\'s what I said! And then I put my ear on it!', 'shout'],\n]);\nS('c4_after', [\n  { stage: 'gallery', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'You heard that, right? In there? It was singing. Quill, the thing in him was singing.', 'shock'],\n  { wait: 1.2 },\n  ['vale', 'Quill?'],\n  { narr: 'For the first time in thirty-one years, Bartholomew Quill says nothing at all.' },\n  { stage: 'radiology', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['odalys', 'It\\'s not in any database. Not one. I checked places I am not allowed to have checked.', 'shock'],\n  ['odalys', 'It\\'s synaptic tissue, like a nerve, but it\\'s colonial. Which means it\\'s a lot of little nerves.'],\n  ['odalys', 'That are alive. In a man. Who feels great.', 'shout'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'mid']], leave: 'odalys' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Not a word. Not to the board, not to the press, not to your mother.', 'angry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Not until I have spoken to the Foundation.'],\n  ['vale', 'The Foundation? Chief, what would the Foundation have to do with...?', 'shock'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They paid for your theatre lights, Dr. Vale. Go and do your rounds.', 'tired'],\n]);\nS('c5_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'ward', enter: [['ilse', 'right', 'cry'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['ilse', 'It hurts.', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'Oh, it hurts. Oh. It hurts so much. My hand. I can feel every string.', 'cry'],\n  ['vale', 'I\\'m sorry, I\\'m so sorry, I can get you something for that, let me just...', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'No. Don\\'t you dare.', 'cry'],\n  ['ilse', 'Thank you.', 'smile'],\n  { stage: 'radiology', leave: 'ilse', enter: [['odalys', 'right', 'shout']] },\n  ['odalys', 'I found it! The captain. The violinist. Eleven others, all feeling great, all in the charts.', 'shout'],\n  ['odalys', 'Every one of them went to an Anodyne clinic. Every one is on Lull. It\\'s the miracle drug!', 'shout'],\n  ['vale', 'Lull is safe. Lull got my nan off morphine. Everyone\\'s on Lull. Half the night shift is on Lull.', 'shock'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smirk']], leave: 'odalys' },\n  ['percy', 'You\\'ve been up for forty hours, Vale. You\\'re hearing singing and accusing a charity.', 'smirk'],\n  ['percy', 'The gala is on Friday. In the new wing. Do try to wear shoes. You look terrible.', 'smirk'],\n  ['vale', 'You look tired too, Percy. Your hands are really steady, though.', 'sad'],\n  ['percy', 'Yes. They are, aren\\'t they.', 'neutral'],\n  { stage: 'gala', leave: ['percy', 'vale'], music: 'title' },\n  { enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']] },\n  ['hale', 'Pain is the last disease. We have beaten smallpox. We have beaten polio.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'I ask you to imagine a child who has never once been afraid of the needle.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired']], leave: 'hale' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'To Dr. Hale. To the Foundation. To the doors of St. Erasmus, which remain, thanks to him...', 'tired'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 3 },\n  { cine: 'gala' },\n  ['vale', 'CHIEF!', 'shout'],\n  ['quill', 'Theatre 3, Doctor. You will have to open her. There is no one else in this city I would hand it to.'],\n]);\nS('c6_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'tension', enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'cry']] },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Your suture line is adequate. Stop crying on it.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'You took Lull. How long? You\\'ve had it for how long? I had my hands in your chest and it SANG.', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'A year. For my hands. This hospital was three months from a padlock, Imogen.', 'tired'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Lucian Hale wrote a check, and asked one thing. Keep his patients out of our charts.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I knew. Not all of it. Enough. That is the whole of my confession, and I shall not repeat it.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They call it HUSH. Hyperplastic Undifferentiated Synaptic Hive. They grew it. It feeds on pain.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They sing, Doctor. So we name them like songs.'],\n  ['vale', 'How do I stop it? Chief, I can barely stop my own knees.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'You stretch a moment. There is someone who does more than that. She takes it back.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Yevgenia Sokolova. Surgeon of the hospital ship Samaritan\\'s Wake. She will be rude to you.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'mid']], sfx: 'clink' },\n  { narr: 'A tray hits the floor. Instruments scatter across the ward. Bartholomew Quill has dropped it.' },\n  { narr: 'He has not dropped one in thirty-one years.' },\n  ['quill', 'Forgive me. I shall get the mop.'],\n  { leave: ['quill', 'oyelaran'], enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']], music: 'none' },\n  { narr: 'On the ward television, the volume low, a kind face.' },\n  ['hale', 'I hear Dr. Oyelaran is recovering. Wonderful. That is wonderful news.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'She has given so much of herself. I do hope she gets some rest. I do hope everyone does.', 'smile'],\n]);\n})();\n"}}}
