s.', 'shout'],\n  ['odalys', 'Every one of them went to an Anodyne clinic. Every one is on Lull. It\\'s the miracle drug!', 'shout'],\n  ['vale', 'Lull is safe. Lull got my nan off morphine. Everyone\\'s on Lull. Half the night shift is on Lull.', 'shock'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smirk']], leave: 'odalys' },\n  ['percy', 'You\\'ve been up for forty hours, Vale. You\\'re hearing singing and accusing a charity.', 'smirk'],\n  ['percy', 'The gala is on Friday. In the new wing. Do try to wear shoes. You look terrible.', 'smirk'],\n  ['vale', 'You look tired too, Percy. Your hands are really steady, though.', 'sad'],\n  ['percy', 'Yes. They are, aren\\'t they.', 'neutral'],\n  { stage: 'gala', leave: ['percy', 'vale'], music: 'title' },\n  { enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']] },\n  ['hale', 'Pain is the last disease. We have beaten smallpox. We have beaten polio.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'I ask you to imagine a child who has never once been afraid of the needle.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired']], leave: 'hale' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'To Dr. Hale. To the Foundation. To the doors of St. Erasmus, which remain, thanks to him...', 'tired'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 3 },\n  { cine: 'gala' },\n  ['vale', 'CHIEF!', 'shout'],\n  ['quill', 'Theatre 3, Doctor. You will have to open her. There is no one else in this city I would hand it to.'],\n]);\nS('c6_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'tension', enter: [['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'cry']] },\n  ['oyelaran', 'Your suture line is adequate. Stop crying on it.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'You took Lull. How long? You\\'ve had it for how long? I had my hands in your chest and it SANG.', 'cry'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'A year. For my hands. This hospital was three months from a padlock, Imogen.', 'tired'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Lucian Hale wrote a check, and asked one thing. Keep his patients out of our charts.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'I knew. Not all of it. Enough. That is the whole of my confession, and I shall not repeat it.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They call it HUSH. Hyperplastic Undifferentiated Synaptic Hive. They grew it. It feeds on pain.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'They sing, Doctor. So we name them like songs.'],\n  ['vale', 'How do I stop it? Chief, I can barely stop my own knees.', 'sad'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'You stretch a moment. There is someone who does more than that. She takes it back.', 'neutral'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'Yevgenia Sokolova. Surgeon of the hospital ship Samaritan\\'s Wake. She will be rude to you.', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'mid']], sfx: 'clink' },\n  { narr: 'A tray hits the floor. Instruments scatter across the ward. Bartholomew Quill has dropped it.' },\n  { narr: 'He has not dropped one in thirty-one years.' },\n  ['quill', 'Forgive me. I shall get the mop.'],\n  { leave: ['quill', 'oyelaran'], enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'smile']], music: 'none' },\n  { narr: 'On the ward television, the volume low, a kind face.' },\n  ['hale', 'I hear Dr. Oyelaran is recovering. Wonderful. That is wonderful news.', 'smile'],\n  ['hale', 'She has given so much of herself. I do hope she gets some rest. I do hope everyone does.', 'smile'],\n]);\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Fdi59YHaCUAoV97wdqNeDC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjrxAENjfqWr3MUBuwBx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C5cz3cCmpbzLjuene4VdFe","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch3.js","content":"// Chapter 3: Second Look. The player becomes Zhenya.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c7_open', [\n  { stage: 'harbor', music: 'tension' },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 3', 'Second Look'] },\n  { cine: 'storm' },\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'This is the ship? It\\'s a rust bucket. It\\'s going to sink. Is this floor supposed to do that?', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'It has been going to sink since 1971, Doctor.'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['sokolova', 'You\\'re late, Bartholomew.', 'smirk'],\n  ['quill', 'Thirty-one years, Yevgenia.'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Hm. You got old. It doesn\\'t suit you. Who is the child in clogs?', 'smirk'],\n  { enter: [['vale', 'left', 'smile']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['vale', 'Dr. Vale! Imogen. Immy. Chief Oyelaran sent me, it\\'s an honor, I read your paper on field...', 'smile'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Marguerite sent you. So she is dying or sorry. Let it wait, dear. You hear that?', 'neutral'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 4 },\n  ['sokolova', 'That was my winch. And that scream will be Yusuf Demir, who is engaged and wishes us to know it.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Come. Stand there. Touch nothing. Watch something un-happen.', 'smirk'],\n]);\nS('c7_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['sokolova', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['vale', 'You cut the artery. I saw it. There was blood on the ceiling. And then there wasn\\'t.', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'At my age, dear, everything happens twice.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'You went BACK. You took it back. That\\'s not, you can\\'t. Does that even...', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Six seconds. It is not much. It is the difference between a widow and a wedding.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I remember the first go. The patient does not. You will find that is the bad part.', 'tired'],\n  { enter: [['perpetua', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['perpetua', 'Doctor Sokolova! Peace be with you. I have brought you nine more from the seamen\\'s hospice.', 'smile'],\n  ['perpetua', 'They have never been happier. It is a grace. You should see them smile.', 'smile'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Sister. You have lost eleven pounds and you are smiling at a bullet wound.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'I had not noticed the wound, Doctor. Is that strange? I feel so well.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c8_after', [\n  { stage: 'chapel', music: 'tension', enter: [['perpetua', 'right', 'cry'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['perpetua', 'My knees. Sweet Lord, my knees. Thirty years of kneeling. I had forgotten. You cruel girl.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'Nine men in my hospice died smiling, Doctor. No terror at the end. Not one.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And you would go in there with your knives and give that back? You\\'d give them back their pain?', 'angry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['sokolova', 'I\\'d give them back their choice.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And when they choose wrong? When they scream for you at four in the morning, what then?', 'angry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Then I come at four in the morning, Sister. As you did. For thirty years. On those knees.', 'sad'],\n  { wait: 1 },\n  ['perpetua', '...Hand me my beads. And then get out of my chapel. And thank you.', 'sad'],\n  { leave: 'perpetua', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['quill', 'That went well, I thought.'],\n  { sfx: 'foghorn', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['crane', 'Dr. Sokolova? Hollis Crane. I was at Anodyne from the start. I\\'ve come to confess. Please.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Don\\'t scan me. Don\\'t touch my chest. I have a pacemaker. They rigged it. I can explain.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'If my heart stops, or the can is forced, it takes this ship with it. I am so very sorry.', 'cry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I see.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'We are doctors.', 'smirk'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'left']] },\n  ['quill', 'I\\'ll fetch the other forceps.'],\n]);\nS('c9_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'tension', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'neutral']] },\n  ['crane', 'I wrote the protocol. We thought we had cured it. Nineteen years, and no child ever cried.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'Cured what? Who was the first? There\\'s always a patient zero. Who got it first?', 'angry'],\n  ['crane', 'She was nine. Bone cancer. Her father couldn\\'t stand it. The greatest bedside voice in medicine.', 'sad'],\n  ['crane', 'He held her hand and he could not make it stop. So he made it stop.', 'sad'],\n  ['vale', 'Hale. Lucian Hale\\'s daughter.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Clementine. Nineteen now. She has not felt anything for ten years. Everything is singing to her.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'All of it. Every patient. Every dose. It\\'s one colony and she\\'s the conductor. She doesn\\'t know.', 'cry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'crane' },\n  ['sokolova', 'Well. There it is.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Bartholomew! Tell the helm. Port Anselm. Tell them not to spare the rust.', 'shout'],\n  { leave: 'sokolova', enter: [['quill', 'mid']] },\n  ['vale', 'You were there, weren\\'t you. Thirty-one years ago. Her and you. What happened?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'She took something back, Doctor. And I remember it. And she knows I do.'],\n  ['quill', 'That is all you shall get from me before breakfast.'],\n]);\n})();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17142,"cache_read_input_tokens":501748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17142},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"455aabbf-dbfa-409a-91df-ba2177dd6342","uuid":"59103be9-1a0a-4cf4-a6c8-0358a9d82e1b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:31:29.404Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjrx9v1pkyh1mq9ahE33","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01C5cz3cCmpbzLjuene4VdFe":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch3.js","content":"// Chapter 3: Second Look. The player becomes Zhenya.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c7_open', [\n  { stage: 'harbor', music: 'tension' },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 3', 'Second Look'] },\n  { cine: 'storm' },\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['vale', 'This is the ship? It\\'s a rust bucket. It\\'s going to sink. Is this floor supposed to do that?', 'shock'],\n  ['quill', 'It has been going to sink since 1971, Doctor.'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['sokolova', 'You\\'re late, Bartholomew.', 'smirk'],\n  ['quill', 'Thirty-one years, Yevgenia.'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Hm. You got old. It doesn\\'t suit you. Who is the child in clogs?', 'smirk'],\n  { enter: [['vale', 'left', 'smile']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['vale', 'Dr. Vale! Imogen. Immy. Chief Oyelaran sent me, it\\'s an honor, I read your paper on field...', 'smile'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Marguerite sent you. So she is dying or sorry. Let it wait, dear. You hear that?', 'neutral'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 4 },\n  ['sokolova', 'That was my winch. And that scream will be Yusuf Demir, who is engaged and wishes us to know it.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Come. Stand there. Touch nothing. Watch something un-happen.', 'smirk'],\n]);\nS('c7_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['sokolova', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['vale', 'You cut the artery. I saw it. There was blood on the ceiling. And then there wasn\\'t.', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'At my age, dear, everything happens twice.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'You went BACK. You took it back. That\\'s not, you can\\'t. Does that even...', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Six seconds. It is not much. It is the difference between a widow and a wedding.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I remember the first go. The patient does not. You will find that is the bad part.', 'tired'],\n  { enter: [['perpetua', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['perpetua', 'Doctor Sokolova! Peace be with you. I have brought you nine more from the seamen\\'s hospice.', 'smile'],\n  ['perpetua', 'They have never been happier. It is a grace. You should see them smile.', 'smile'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Sister. You have lost eleven pounds and you are smiling at a bullet wound.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'I had not noticed the wound, Doctor. Is that strange? I feel so well.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c8_after', [\n  { stage: 'chapel', music: 'tension', enter: [['perpetua', 'right', 'cry'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['perpetua', 'My knees. Sweet Lord, my knees. Thirty years of kneeling. I had forgotten. You cruel girl.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'Nine men in my hospice died smiling, Doctor. No terror at the end. Not one.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And you would go in there with your knives and give that back? You\\'d give them back their pain?', 'angry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['sokolova', 'I\\'d give them back their choice.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And when they choose wrong? When they scream for you at four in the morning, what then?', 'angry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Then I come at four in the morning, Sister. As you did. For thirty years. On those knees.', 'sad'],\n  { wait: 1 },\n  ['perpetua', '...Hand me my beads. And then get out of my chapel. And thank you.', 'sad'],\n  { leave: 'perpetua', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['quill', 'That went well, I thought.'],\n  { sfx: 'foghorn', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['crane', 'Dr. Sokolova? Hollis Crane. I was at Anodyne from the start. I\\'ve come to confess. Please.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Don\\'t scan me. Don\\'t touch my chest. I have a pacemaker. They rigged it. I can explain.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'If my heart stops, or the can is forced, it takes this ship with it. I am so very sorry.', 'cry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I see.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'We are doctors.', 'smirk'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'left']] },\n  ['quill', 'I\\'ll fetch the other forceps.'],\n]);\nS('c9_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'tension', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'neutral']] },\n  ['crane', 'I wrote the protocol. We thought we had cured it. Nineteen years, and no child ever cried.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'Cured what? Who was the first? There\\'s always a patient zero. Who got it first?', 'angry'],\n  ['crane', 'She was nine. Bone cancer. Her father couldn\\'t stand it. The greatest bedside voice in medicine.', 'sad'],\n  ['crane', 'He held her hand and he could not make it stop. So he made it stop.', 'sad'],\n  ['vale', 'Hale. Lucian Hale\\'s daughter.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Clementine. Nineteen now. She has not felt anything for ten years. Everything is singing to her.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'All of it. Every patient. Every dose. It\\'s one colony and she\\'s the conductor. She doesn\\'t know.', 'cry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'crane' },\n  ['sokolova', 'Well. There it is.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Bartholomew! Tell the helm. Port Anselm. Tell them not to spare the rust.', 'shout'],\n  { leave: 'sokolova', enter: [['quill', 'mid']] },\n  ['vale', 'You were there, weren\\'t you. Thirty-one years ago. Her and you. What happened?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'She took something back, Doctor. And I remember it. And she knows I do.'],\n  ['quill', 'That is all you shall get from me before breakfast.'],\n]);\n})();\n"}}}
