nd that scream will be Yusuf Demir, who is engaged and wishes us to know it.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Come. Stand there. Touch nothing. Watch something un-happen.', 'smirk'],\n]);\nS('c7_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'ward', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'shock'], ['sokolova', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['vale', 'You cut the artery. I saw it. There was blood on the ceiling. And then there wasn\\'t.', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'At my age, dear, everything happens twice.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'You went BACK. You took it back. That\\'s not, you can\\'t. Does that even...', 'shock'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Six seconds. It is not much. It is the difference between a widow and a wedding.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I remember the first go. The patient does not. You will find that is the bad part.', 'tired'],\n  { enter: [['perpetua', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['perpetua', 'Doctor Sokolova! Peace be with you. I have brought you nine more from the seamen\\'s hospice.', 'smile'],\n  ['perpetua', 'They have never been happier. It is a grace. You should see them smile.', 'smile'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Sister. You have lost eleven pounds and you are smiling at a bullet wound.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'I had not noticed the wound, Doctor. Is that strange? I feel so well.', 'smile'],\n]);\nS('c8_after', [\n  { stage: 'chapel', music: 'tension', enter: [['perpetua', 'right', 'cry'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['perpetua', 'My knees. Sweet Lord, my knees. Thirty years of kneeling. I had forgotten. You cruel girl.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'Nine men in my hospice died smiling, Doctor. No terror at the end. Not one.', 'cry'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And you would go in there with your knives and give that back? You\\'d give them back their pain?', 'angry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['sokolova', 'I\\'d give them back their choice.', 'neutral'],\n  ['perpetua', 'And when they choose wrong? When they scream for you at four in the morning, what then?', 'angry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Then I come at four in the morning, Sister. As you did. For thirty years. On those knees.', 'sad'],\n  { wait: 1 },\n  ['perpetua', '...Hand me my beads. And then get out of my chapel. And thank you.', 'sad'],\n  { leave: 'perpetua', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  ['quill', 'That went well, I thought.'],\n  { sfx: 'foghorn', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'shock']], leave: 'quill' },\n  ['crane', 'Dr. Sokolova? Hollis Crane. I was at Anodyne from the start. I\\'ve come to confess. Please.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Don\\'t scan me. Don\\'t touch my chest. I have a pacemaker. They rigged it. I can explain.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'If my heart stops, or the can is forced, it takes this ship with it. I am so very sorry.', 'cry'],\n  ['sokolova', 'I see.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'We are doctors.', 'smirk'],\n  { enter: [['quill', 'left']] },\n  ['quill', 'I\\'ll fetch the other forceps.'],\n]);\nS('c9_after', [\n  { stage: 'shipward', music: 'tension', enter: [['crane', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'neutral']] },\n  ['crane', 'I wrote the protocol. We thought we had cured it. Nineteen years, and no child ever cried.', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'Cured what? Who was the first? There\\'s always a patient zero. Who got it first?', 'angry'],\n  ['crane', 'She was nine. Bone cancer. Her father couldn\\'t stand it. The greatest bedside voice in medicine.', 'sad'],\n  ['crane', 'He held her hand and he could not make it stop. So he made it stop.', 'sad'],\n  ['vale', 'Hale. Lucian Hale\\'s daughter.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'Clementine. Nineteen now. She has not felt anything for ten years. Everything is singing to her.', 'shock'],\n  ['crane', 'All of it. Every patient. Every dose. It\\'s one colony and she\\'s the conductor. She doesn\\'t know.', 'cry'],\n  { enter: [['sokolova', 'mid', 'neutral']], leave: 'crane' },\n  ['sokolova', 'Well. There it is.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'Bartholomew! Tell the helm. Port Anselm. Tell them not to spare the rust.', 'shout'],\n  { leave: 'sokolova', enter: [['quill', 'mid']] },\n  ['vale', 'You were there, weren\\'t you. Thirty-one years ago. Her and you. What happened?', 'sad'],\n  ['quill', 'She took something back, Doctor. And I remember it. And she knows I do.'],\n  ['quill', 'That is all you shall get from me before breakfast.'],\n]);\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01C5cz3cCmpbzLjuene4VdFe","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjrxAENjfqWr3MUBuwBx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015tzG1suzghmuXxH3SVFPCR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch4.js","content":"// Chapter 4: Coda. And the ward's talk, for every chapter.\n(() => { const G = (window.GAME ||= {}), S = G.defStory;\nS('c10_open', [\n  { stage: 'corridor', music: 'tension', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'neutral'], ['sokolova', 'right', 'smirk']] },\n  { card: ['CHAPTER 4', 'Coda'] },\n  ['sokolova', 'So this is St. Raz\\'s. It has not improved. Which one of these pale children is in charge?', 'smirk'],\n  ['vale', 'Percy? Percy, it\\'s me. We need your films from the last six... you look awful. Are you okay?', 'sad'],\n  { enter: [['percy', 'mid', 'smile']], leave: 'sokolova' },\n  ['percy', 'Immy.', 'smile'],\n  ['vale', 'You\\'ve never called me that. Percy, why are you smiling?', 'shock'],\n  ['percy', 'You know how I never miss? My hands never shake. Did you ever wonder about that?', 'smile'],\n  ['percy', 'I was so frightened. Every day, top of the year, so frightened. I just wanted to keep up.', 'sad'],\n  ['percy', 'And now it\\'s finally quiet.', 'smile'],\n  { sfx: 'thud', shake: 2, flash: '#ffffff' },\n  ['vale', 'Percy! PERCY! Somebody, help me, somebody get a gurney! Quill! QUILL!', 'shout'],\n  { leave: 'percy', enter: [['sokolova', 'right', 'neutral']] },\n  ['sokolova', 'Both of us, then. Your stretch and my rewind. I have never done this with anyone. Have you?', 'neutral'],\n  ['vale', 'I\\'ve never done anything with anyone! Yes! Okay! Sorry!', 'shock'],\n]);\nS('c10_after', [\n  { stage: 'wardroom', music: 'ward', enter: [['percy', 'right', 'tired'], ['vale', 'left', 'sad']] },\n  ['percy', 'Ow.', 'tired'],\n  ['percy', 'Ow. Ow. Oh, that\\'s dreadful. Everything is dreadful. Who sewed my head?', 'tired'],\n  ['vale', 'Me. I did. Me and... Percy, I thought you were...', 'cry'],\n  ['percy', 'Your stitches are crooked.', 'smirk'],\n  { narr: 'Imogen Vale cries, and laughs, and cannot tell which. Nor can anyone else in the ward.' },\n  { sfx: 'alarm', enter: [['odalys', 'mid', 'shock']], leave: 'percy', music: 'emergency' },\n  ['odalys', 'Doctor. Every Anodyne patient in Port Anselm just crashed. All of them. In the same minute.', 'shock'],\n  ['odalys', 'Pulse rates, every one, in time. Doctor. They are all beating IN TIME.', 'shout'],\n  { sfx: 'door', leave: 'odalys', enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'cry']], stage: 'corridor' },\n  { cine: 'final' },\n  ['hale', 'Please.', 'cry'],\n  { narr: 'He has carried her in himself, through the rain, from the new wing. She smiles at everyone.' },\n  ['hale', 'I gave a city my daughter\\'s peace. I thought it was the kindest thing that had ever been done.', 'cry'],\n  ['hale', 'I only wanted her not to hurt.', 'cry'],\n  { enter: [['clementine', 'right', 'smile']] },\n  ['clementine', 'It\\'s all right, Daddy. Doesn\\'t it sound lovely? Hello, Doctor. Are you going to make it stop?', 'smile'],\n  { enter: [['oyelaran', 'left', 'tired']], leave: 'vale' },\n  ['oyelaran', 'I shall be in the gallery, Doctor. In a wheelchair, and in a filthy temper. Do not embarrass me.', 'tired'],\n  { leave: ['hale', 'clementine', 'oyelaran'], enter: [['vale', 'left', 'neutral'], ['quill', 'right']], mask: true, music: 'none' },\n  ['quill', 'Hands, Doctor.'],\n  ['vale', 'They\\'re shaking.', 'neutral'],\n  ['quill', 'Yes.'],\n  ['vale', 'Forceps.', 'neutral'],\n]);\nS('c11_after', [\n  { stage: 'gallery', music: 'none', enter: [['vale', 'left', 'tired'], ['quill', 'right']] },\n  { wait: 2 },\n  { narr: 'Silence. One long second of it. And then, from the table, one small, furious sound.' },\n  { enter: [['clementine', 'mid', 'cry']] },\n  ['clementine', 'AAAAH! It hurts! It hurts it hurts it HURTS! Oh!', 'shout'],\n  ['clementine', 'I can feel my hands. Daddy. Daddy, look. I can feel my HANDS!', 'cry'],\n  { music: 'ending', stage: 'corridor', leave: 'clementine', enter: [['agnes', 'right', 'angry']] },\n  { cine: 'er' },\n  ['agnes', 'Young woman! I have a headache!', 'angry'],\n  ['vale', 'Wonderful!', 'smile'],\n  { leave: 'agnes', enter: [['harrow', 'right', 'angry']] },\n  ['harrow', 'I have a hole in my side, and it stings something awful! Who do I shout at?', 'shout'],\n  ['vale', 'Me! Shout at me! Isn\\'t it great?', 'smile'],\n  { narr: 'The city wakes in pain. St. Raz\\'s ER is the happiest, loudest, most furious place on earth.' },\n  { stage: 'harbor', leave: 'harrow', enter: [['hale', 'mid', 'tired'], ['oyelaran', 'right', 'tired']] },\n  ['hale', 'I shall tell them everything, Marguerite. I would like to be gentle about it. May I?', 'tired'],\n  ['oyelaran', 'You may hold out your wrists, Lucian. You always had lovely manners.', 'tired'],\n  { stage: 'scrub', leave: ['hale', 'oyelaran'], enter: [['sokolova', 'right', 'smirk']] },\n  ['sokolova', 'I am going back to my ship, Bartholomew. It will sink without me. You could come.', 'smirk'],\n  ['quill', 'You could stay, Yevgenia.', 'neutral'],\n  ['sokolova', 'No. Again.', 'smile'],\n  { leave: 'sokolova', enter: [['quill', 'right']] },\n  { narr: 'Morning. Rain. The scrub room is empty. Imogen Vale washes her hands, and looks at them.' },\n  ['quill', 'They\\'ve stopped shaking, Doctor.'],\n  { narr: 'She looks again.' },\n  ['vale', 'No, they haven\\'t.', 'smile'],\n  ['quill', 'Good.'],\n]);\n// ------------------------------------------------------------------ Ward talk: each person, new lines per chapter. Keys: person id -> chapter -> lines\nG.WARD_TALK = {\n  quill: { 1: [['quill', 'I am knitting, Doctor. It is a hat. It may yet be a sock.'], ['quill', 'You have time. The next one will still be dying when you get there.']], 2: [['quill', 'You heard it singing. I do not have an opinion. I have a mop.']], 3: [['quill', 'The sea is rough. I shall knit through it. I knit through the war.'], ['quill', 'No. You may not ask me about her.']], 4: [['quill', 'Thirty-one years, and it comes down to a Tuesday. It always does.']] },\n  percy: { 1: [['percy', 'This machine has taken my money. It is unaware of who I am.', 'smirk']], 2: [['percy', 'I got a Clean on the double bypass. Clean, Vale. Forty hours, and not a tremor.', 'smirk']], 4: [['percy', 'I am told the vending machine still owes me. I can feel my head. Is that normal?', 'tired']] },\n  odalys: { 1: [['odalys', 'Half a sandwich? I am not offering, I am only telling you I have one.', 'smile']], 2: [['odalys', 'I have forty-one charts on my wall and red string. Nobody is allowed in here. Come in.', 'shock']], 4: [['odalys', 'I ran it again. I was right. I am always right. Do you know how tiring it is?', 'smile']] },\n  chief: { 1: [['oyelaran', 'I am reading, Doctor. My door is closed for a reason. The reason is you.', 'neutral']], 2: [['oyelaran', 'Are you still standing in my doorway? Go. And Doctor, watch your hands.', 'tired']], 4: [['oyelaran', 'Wheel me to the gallery. I wish to shout at someone competent.', 'tired']] },\n  agnes: { 2: [['agnes', 'My grandchildren brought begonias. I told them, not near the glass. They are very good.', 'smile']], 4: [['agnes', 'You look tired, dear. There is a jam jar in my drawer, if you need something to cry in.', 'smile']] },\n  slide: { 2: [['slide', 'Doc! They let me practice if I use the mute. Listen to that low B-flat. Listen!', 'smile']], 4: [['slide', 'Thursday set is on. Front row\\'s yours, Doc. Bring the nurse who doesn\\'t smile.', 'smile']] },\n  tam: { 2: [['tam', 'My dog is at my sister\\'s. Someone told me you asked after her, on the table. I heard that.', 'smile']], 4: [['tam', 'Foreman says the crane is fixed. Foreman is me. I can fix it, I mean. Give me a week.', 'smile']] },\n  harrow: { 4: [['harrow', 'Named it Doris. Ow. Ow! Isn\\'t that something? I had forgotten about ow.', 'smile']] },\n  ilse: { 4: [['ilse', 'I played a scale this morning and cried all through it. It was the best scale of my life.', 'cry']] },\n  yusuf: { 3: [['yusuf', 'She says yes! I radioed. Doctor, I would like you to know I am engaged.', 'smile']] },\n  perpetua: { 3: [['perpetua', 'I do not forgive you yet. My knees and I are still in discussion.', 'tired']] },\n  crane: { 4: [['crane', 'Thank you for the second opinion. I am so sorry about the can. And the ship.', 'sad']] },\n  sokolova: { 3: [['sokolova', 'That lamp has swung like that since Suez. Go and sleep, dear. You will not.', 'smirk']] },\n  door: { 1: [['quill', 'Theatre 3. Whenever you are ready, Doctor. Or before.']], 2: [['quill', 'Theatre 3. Whenever you are ready, Doctor. Or before.']], 3: [['quill', 'The sick bay, Doctor. Mind the step. It moves.']], 4: [['quill', 'Theatre 3, Doctor. All of us. Mind how you go.']] },\n};\n})();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17142,"cache_read_input_tokens":501748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17142},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"455aabbf-dbfa-409a-91df-ba2177dd6342","uuid":"fdadc3ed-7748-4289-8651-8b1e7d939fd1","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:32:10.285Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjrx9v1pkyh1mq9ahE33","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015tzG1suzghmuXxH3SVFPCR":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-054007__x488eb9/work/TraumaBenderSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-054007/src/data/story/ch4.js","content":"// Chapter 4: Coda. And the ward's talk, for every chapter.\n(() 